### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/

### Swagger UI
GET http://localhost:3000/docs

### OpenAPI JSON
GET http://localhost:3000/docs/json

### ==========================================
### PUBLIC ENDPOINTS
### ==========================================

### List products
GET http://localhost:3000/products

### List products with filters
GET http://localhost:3000/products?name=test&minPrice=10&maxPrice=500&sort=price-asc

### Get product by ID (replace :id with actual ID)
GET http://localhost:3000/products/clx...

### List brands
GET http://localhost:3000/brands

### Get brand by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/brands/clx...

### List categories
GET http://localhost:3000/categories

### List clients
GET http://localhost:3000/clients

### Get client by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/clients/clx...

### List orders
GET http://localhost:3000/orders

### Get orders by client ID
GET http://localhost:3000/orders/client/clx...

### ==========================================
### PROTECTED ENDPOINTS (requires JWT token)
### ==========================================

### Login / Get token from auth-service first
### Then set @token variable below

### Create product
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "New Product",
  "description": "Product description",
  "price": "199.99",
  "stock": 10,
  "sku": "SKU-001",
  "categoryId": "clx...",
  "brandId": "clx...",
  "images": [],
  "tags": ["new", "product"]
}

### Update product
PUT http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "id": "clx...",
  "name": "Updated Product",
  "price": "149.99"
}

### Delete product
DELETE http://localhost:3000/products/clx...
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create brand
POST http://localhost:3000/brands
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "NewBrand",
  "logo": "https://example.com/logo.png",
  "website": "https://example.com"
}

### Update brand
PUT http://localhost:3000/brands/clx...
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Updated Brand"
}

### Delete brand
DELETE http://localhost:3000/brands/clx...
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create category
POST http://localhost:3000/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "New Category"
}

### Update category
PUT http://localhost:3000/categories/clx...
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Updated Category"
}

### Delete category
DELETE http://localhost:3000/categories/clx...
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create order
POST http://localhost:3000/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "clx...",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 99.99
    }
  ]
}

### Cancel order
PATCH http://localhost:3000/orders/clx.../cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Increment product stock
POST http://localhost:3000/products/clx.../increment-stock
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "quantity": 5
}

### Increment product views
POST http://localhost:3000/products/clx.../increment-views
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Apply discount to product
POST http://localhost:3000/products/clx.../apply-discount
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "discountType": "PERCENTAGE"
}

### Disable product discount
POST http://localhost:3000/products/clx.../disable-discount
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Analytics counts
GET http://localhost:3000/analytics/counts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Stock movements
GET http://localhost:3000/products/stock-movements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
